  "@type": "Process",
  "critical": false,
  "description": "Blending of natural and synthetic rubbers with carbon black, silica, oils, antioxidants, antiozonants, accelerators, and sulfur (vulcanizing agent) in an internal mixer (Banbury). The compound is sheeted on a mill and calendered onto cord fabric to produce rubberized ply stock. Compound formulation dictates wear, grip, and rolling resistance.",
